<title>POLAND: WARTA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 45.6.</title>
<headline>WARTA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 45.6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 3,999 shares in Warta SA at 45.6 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Warta traded at 46.5 zlotys in a 1,718-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
